menuconfig XSPI_MST_SLV
    bool "XSPI Master and Slave Driver Support"
    default n

if XSPI_MST_SLV

config XSPI_MST
    bool "Taishan XSPI Master"
    default n
    ---help---
    Use XSPI controller as master device, so we can directlly read and
    write memory and register spaces of an external XSPI slave device
    through memory mapped APB area of the XSPI master.

config XSPI_SLV
    bool "Taishan XSPI Slave"
    default n
    ---help---
    Use XSPI controller as slave device, so an external XSPI master can
    directlly read and write memory and register spaces of this device.

endif # XSPI_MST_SLV
